@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title US010 - To register a new publication in MiteLovers

' As a User, I want to register a new publication
' in the system, so that I can add the
' publication to my library.


actor User
participant ":MiteLovers" as UI


'Interactions
User -> UI : I want to register a publication
Activate UI
UI --> User : Please enter the publication that you want to add on MiteLovers
deactivate UI
User -> UI : It's called <pub1>, with the publication type and bibliographical data
activate UI
UI --> User : New publication added on MiteLovers successfully.
deactivate UI
@enduml